---
import { packages } from '../data/packages';
import Arrow from './Arrow.astro';
---
<section id="services" class="packages shell section-space" aria-labelledby="packages-heading">
  <div class="section-intro"><div><p class="eyebrow">Services & pricing</p><h2 id="packages-heading">A STARTING POINT.<br/><em>SHAPED TO FIT.</em></h2></div><p>Three starting packages. Your requirements determine the final scope, deliverables and quote.</p></div>
  <div class="pricing-canvas">{packages.map((plan, i) => <article class:list={['plan', { 'plan-business': plan.name === 'Business' }]}>
    <div class="plan-title"><span class="plan-index" aria-hidden="true">{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><div><h3>{plan.name}</h3><p>{plan.description}</p></div></div>
    <p class="price"><span>From</span> <strong>RM{plan.price}</strong></p><div class="plan-scope"><p class="page-scope">{plan.pages}</p><p>{plan.revisions}</p></div>
    <a href="#contact" data-package={plan.name} class="plan-link" aria-label={`Enquire about ${plan.name}`}><Arrow diagonal/></a>
  </article>)}</div>
  <div class="pricing-details"><p>Every package includes mobile-responsive layouts, basic on-page SEO and clear contact actions.</p><p>Starter uses template-informed design; Business and Premium allow more extensive reusable layouts. All packages cover frontend websites.</p></div>
  <p class="pricing-note">Prices are starting estimates in Malaysian ringgit (RM), not fixed quotes. Content, complexity and functionality affect the final quote. Backend systems, databases, e-commerce checkout and operational booking systems are excluded. Domain registration, hosting and recurring third-party costs, ongoing maintenance and paid services are separately scoped unless agreed in writing. Search engine rankings are not guaranteed.</p>
</section>
